~15~Question: 
When I try to enter an equation into a field I get a beeping sound.
~15~Answer:
You hear a beep when you enter a wrong character. Remember, enter the equation as you would on paper. For the variable name use x. When you enter a power type the power value without the ^ character. If you want to enter x squared type x2, and 2 will automatically became the power of x.    

~15~Question:
How do exit GraphXY?
~15~Answer:
Exiting GraphXY is easy, just press ESC key.

